  "name": "Question 1",
  "problem": "Given the following piecewise function $f(x),$ what is $f(5)?$\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}4,\\, & x\\le 5 \\\\ 5,\\, & x>5\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "worked_solution": "Since $x=5$ is in the interval $x\\le 5,$ we use the left-hand branch, namely $f(x)=4:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(5) & =4\\end{aligned}\n$$",
